Short:        BOOPSI image class for XPM images
Author:       lorens@hem.passagen.se
Uploader:     lorens hem passagen se
Type:         dev/c
Requires:     SAS/C
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

A BOOPSI image class that acts as a wrapper for the XPM library
functions.  A compiled version of the XPM library is included in the
archive.  For more information of the XPM format and library, see
http://www.inria.fr/koala/lehors/xpm.html.  The XPM distribution is
available at ftp://koala.inria.fr/pub/xpm.
